    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71996" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄγχνη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pear-tree, Pirus communis,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				7.115
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				11.589
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				24.234
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				2.5.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>pear,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				7.120
			</span></i>.—Written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄχνη</span> in
				<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				1.134
			</span></i> (where acc. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄχνᾰς</span>),
				<i><span class="en">
				7.144
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				513
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Ren.Ves.</u>
				14.6
			</span></i>, and this form is v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>:—<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> also has <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄγχνια:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπιον.</span></div>
